{"4591530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Colony", "steam_appid": 4591530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4855390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StarColony is a resource management &amp; incremental space colony building game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591530/extras/4f17a7baa2b14b9196e6164880f9b297.poster.avif?t=1787908264\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591530/extras/4f17a7baa2b14b9196e6164880f9b297.webm?t=1787908264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591530/extras/4f17a7baa2b14b9196e6164880f9b297.mp4?t=1787908264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Overview</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a new habitable planet with nothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thaw your population, build structures, and produce resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on supply &amp; demand — if you run out of food, your population will suffer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more buildings, and support a growing number of population.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various planets in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space colonization !</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591530/extras/afeb6960bdb57d32c29cf543668b5b2d.poster.avif?t=1787908264\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591530/extras/afeb6960bdb57d32c29cf543668b5b2d.webm?t=1787908